{2}│{R}{1}⦿ Upgrade packages inside otter managed containers {R}{2}│{R}
{2}├───────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Usage:{R}                                           {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  otter upgrade my-box                             {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  otter upgrade --all                              {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  otter upgrade --running                          {2}│{R}
{2}├───────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Options:{R}                                         {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--all{R}     ┆ {4}-a{R}  Perform for all otters            {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--root{R}    ┆ {4}-r{R}  Upgrade rootful containers        {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--running{R}       Only upgrade running containers   {2}│{R}
{2}├───────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Extras:{R}                                          {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--help{R}    ┆ {4}-h{R}  Show this help message            {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--verbose{R} ┆ {4}-v{R}  Show more verbose output          {2}│{R}
{2}├───────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Notes:{R}                                           {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--root{R}  Prefer over 'sudo otter'.                 {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}         Set OTR_SUDO_PROGRAM to use different app.{2}│{R}
{2}├───────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ See also:{R}                                        {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  Rootful containers need '--root' for 'upgrade'.  {2}│{R}
{2}╰───────────────────────────────────────────────────╯{R}
